story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Will County runs 75 years back to 1951, and September to October came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them. In 2025 that pair came in at 48% of normal on the middle, and January to February came in at 41%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 157% of normal and June to July at 154% on the middle. Grid 25968 had its driest year in 1956 at 66%.</p>"}
